@startuml
skinparam rectangle {
    BackgroundColor<<register>> #E0E0E0
    BorderColor Black
}

rectangle "Host Controller Version Register (Offset 0FEh)" <<register>> {
    |D15|D08|D07|D00|
    |Vendor Version Number|Specification Version Number|
}

note right
  **Bit Fields:**
  
  **D15-D08: Vendor Version Number**
  - Reserved for vendor version number
  - Host Driver should not use this status
  
  **D07-D00: Specification Version Number**
  - Indicates Host Controller Spec Version
  - Upper and lower 4-bits indicate version
  
  **Version Encoding:**
  - 00h: SD Host Specification Version 1.00
  - 01h: SD Host Specification Version 2.00
          (Including ADMA and Test Register)
  - 02h: SD Host Specification Version 3.00
  - others: Reserved
end note

@enduml